{
  "bookId": "rewind-40",
  "id": "chapter-162",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35524001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "捉老鼠的时间到！关灯是没有用的，夜里的我看得更清楚喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "见不得人的小老鼠，你在哪里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "啪——灯亮了。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "哈莉，萝贝卡？喂，醒醒，大喇叭？幼稚园小鬼？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "唔……龙虾……烤肉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "呼……呼……讨厌的臭猫咪……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "梦里居然还不忘记骂我，你不会是在装睡吧？早知道不来救你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "哒——哒——哒——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "你的脚步声这么重，该减肥了喵。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狐狸怪盗",
          "text": "嗯……比我预定的时间提前了三十分钟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "我想什么时候来就什么时候来喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "你就是那个因为长得太丑不敢见人，所以一直戴着面具绑架女孩子的采花大盗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狐狸怪盗",
          "text": "真是特别的解释，很有意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "那你可以让她们俩回去了，我来陪你玩喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狐狸怪盗",
          "text": "哦？莫急莫急……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "再靠近一点喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狐狸怪盗",
          "text": "在下只是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "现在！尝尝猫爪子的厉害——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狐狸怪盗",
          "text": "需要你安静地睡一觉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35524020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵……什么……味道……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35525001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "逗猫真是有趣，差点忘记正事。醒醒吧，可以不用装了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35525002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "她居然真的来了，怎么办怎么办！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35525003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "猫的领地意识很强，尤其是对被划进自己领地范围里的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35525004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "哇，第一次看到她这么安静的样子。臭猫咪和哈莉不会有事吧，你得保证！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35525005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "放心莫急，这种药水最多只会让人梦到一些印象深刻的事物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-842",
