      "title": "猫的新家·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35528001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "回……家……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "咦，臭猫咪在说什么梦话？回……家？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "时间确实不早了，教训完她你们就回去吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "什么教训啊，都这个时候了！我，我们……现在就回基地！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "我记得你说「要给她一个印象深刻的教训」……不打她一顿出气吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "平常也可以，她现在不能还手，没意思！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "那不如把她送离M城？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "不行！因为……因为那样不就不能报仇了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "午夜一过，药水就会失效，还剩……最后十分钟。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我、我、我想……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "你想什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我想带她们回家！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "啊，哈哈哈，那倒是有些麻烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "主人说过，什么麻烦你肯定都有办法解决的！快想想嘛！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "嗯……要拖着她俩在十分钟内回去，这可是个体力活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "这个我可以，只要找个箱子把她们俩放进去，这个就不错——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "那好，她们俩就交给你自己喽。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "哎，你就是想偷懒吧？！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "当然不是，在下还要负责更大的麻烦，比如外面的那几位……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "吱呀——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "狂霸虎",
          "text": "门开了！兄弟们！上——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿斩仙",
          "text": "有我们兄弟三人在，今天你别想轻易逃走！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "终于肯出来了吗？希望这次见面，我锯开的不只是你的披风。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528024",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "滋——滋滋——滋滋滋！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35528025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诸葛孔明",
          "text": "有劳各位惦记了。哎……这下麻烦大了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-844",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "2023mifia",
          "rowIds": [
            35528001,
            35528002,
            35528003,
            35528004,
            35528005,
            35528006,
            35528007,
