      "title": "猫的新家·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35530001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "唰啦——唰啦——唰啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "好重，可恶，你们俩该减肥了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530003",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "嗯……笨蛋……幼稚……萝贝卡",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "梦里还骂我！你……该不会醒了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "嗯……呼噜……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "呼，还睡着啊……吓死了。不行，要来不及了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530007",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "唰啦——唰啦——唰啦——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "怎么还有这么远！我再也不离家出走了呜呜呜哇！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35530009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "叮咚叮咚叮咚——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "门铃响了，难道是哈莉和萝贝卡回来了吗？！我去看——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根·鎏金雅韵",
          "text": "你们后退，我去开门。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "说起来，每次挡在最前面的那个人，总是梅根队长呢。但是这次，我也想和队长站在一起。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "梅根，一起去吧。不论门后是好是坏，大家一起面对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣……葵也是。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根·鎏金雅韵",
          "text": "你们误会了其实我……好吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我……我回来了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "萝贝卡！你跑去哪里了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "萝贝卡，你没事……太好了！大家都好担心你！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "呜呜呜哇！我再也不离家出走了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "说到做到，为了让你记住这个教训，明天开始训练翻倍！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根·鎏金雅韵",
          "text": "等一下……米菲亚和哈莉在哪？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "是啊，她们怎么没跟你一起回来？难道她们……不会吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "你居然抛弃同伴一个人回来的吗，萝贝卡？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "我没有！她们在这！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531017",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "嗯……喵……呼噜……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "啊！是米菲亚和哈莉！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "嘘——你小点声，她们睡着了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "离家出走一趟居然学会关心人了，萝贝卡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "呣……葵也想睡觉……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "这下可以放心了呢，梅根队长。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根·鎏金雅韵",
          "text": "嗯，大家都没事……快把她们搬进来吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "三、二、一，一起抬进来。\n你从哪找来的礼盒，萝贝卡？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "就是、就是、就是醒来看到的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根·鎏金雅韵",
          "text": "总之，不论怎么样，平安回来就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "铛——铛——铛",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35531028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "十二点了啊，真是太好了，大家都平安回家了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
